# Setup Cat: the same wizard used on first launch, current choices and live previews.
Output assets/readme/setup.gif
# demo-config: {"onboardingComplete":false,"glyphChoiceComplete":false,"toolsSetupComplete":false}

Hide
Type "cd ~/Projects/demo && clear && nmsh"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Show

Sleep 2s
Tab
Sleep 2s
Tab
Sleep 2s
Tab
Sleep 2s
Tab
Sleep 2s
Type "p"
Sleep 3s
Escape
Sleep 1s
